Package: libavfilter-dev
Version: @DEB_FFMPEG_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Development
Priority: optional
Depends: libavfilter8 (= @DEB_FFMPEG_V@), libavcodec-dev (= @DEB_FFMPEG_V@), libavformat-dev (= @DEB_FFMPEG_V@), libswscale-dev (= @DEB_FFMPEG_V@), libswresample-dev (= @DEB_FFMPEG_V@), libpostproc-dev (= @DEB_FFMPEG_V@), libavutil-dev (= @DEB_FFMPEG_V@)
Description: FFmpeg filtering library - development
